-- input.md --
Colour one term: ${\color{red} a^2} + {\color{blue} b^2} = \textcolor{green}{c^2}$

Infix scope: $x^2 \over 2$ and $1 \over \int\limits_0^1 f$

Single cell: $\begin{pmatrix} \frac{1}{2} \end{pmatrix}$

Script at cell start: $\begin{matrix} a & ^2 b \\ c & d \end{matrix}$

Spaced delimiters: $\left ( \frac{a}{b} \right )$ and $\big ( x \big )$

Substack in a cell: $\begin{matrix} \substack{a\\b} & y \\ c & d \end{matrix}$

Line break:

$$
a = 1 \\ b = 2
$$

Operator: $\operatorname*{argmax}_x f(x) = \mathop{\mathrm{arg\,max}}_x f(x) \tag{1}$
